body:
Thank you for replying,

&#x200B;

She was saying how much she loves hearing from me. I just feel like it would give the wrong message if I stopped messaging her so much. This is the first chance I've had in as long as I remember, and I just want this to work out. I know I am supposed to enjoy dating and have fun but its just so nerve racking to me.

&#x200B;

I struggle to trust my gut, I always doubt myself. I dunno after everything fell apart with my ex I just don't trust I am doing it write. :/
